{"event": "step_update", "task_id": "BENCH-008", "arm": "baseline", "model": "swe-2-max-lightning", "run_index": 8, "step_update": {"step_index": 0, "state": "DONE", "step_type": "tool", "phase": "tool", "tool_name": "run_command", "tool_info": {"name": "run_command", "parameters": "export PATH=$HOME/.pyenv/shims:$PATH; START=$(date +%s); echo \"START=$START\"; cp -r ~/repos/Ai-Lab/benchmarks/BENCH-008/workspace /tmp/trial_BENCH-008_baseline_r8 && cd /tmp/trial_BENCH-008_baseline_r8 && cat INSTRUCTIONS.md && ls -la && python3 -m pytest tests/ -x -q 2>&1 | tail -15", "output": "START=1795291491\n# BENCH-008: Concurrent Worker Lease, Retry Jitter & SQLite Rollback\n\n## Assignment\nFix the concurrent lease race, SQLite partial-commit leak, retry/DLQ lifecycle, and backoff jitter bugs across four modules:\n- `models.py` (`Job`, `JobStatus`, `InvalidTransitionError`, `LeaseError`, `validate_transition`)\n- `retry.py` (`compute_backoff`)\n- `queue_store.py` (`QueueStore`)\n- `worker.py` (`WorkerPool`)\n\n## Public Contract & Invariants\n\n### 1. `models.py`\n- `JobStatus(str, Enum)`: `PENDING`, `RUNNING`, `COMPLETED`, `DLQ`.\n- `InvalidTransitionError(ValueError)` and `LeaseError(RuntimeError)`.\n- `validate_transition(from_status: JobStatus, to_status: JobStatus) -> None`:\n  Allowed transitions:\n  - `PENDING -> {RUNNING, DLQ}`\n  - `RUNNING -> {COMPLETED, PENDING, DLQ, RUNNING}` (where `RUNNING -> RUNNING` only occurs on expired-lease reclaim/re-claim)\n  - `COMPLETED -> set()` (terminal)\n  - `DLQ -> set()` (terminal)\n  Raises `InvalidTransitionError` for disallowed transitions."}, "duration_seconds": 0.8409998416900635}}
